2️⃣ Slice Template kya hota hai? (Simple language)

Slice Template ek DESIGN-TIME contract hai

Ye define karta hai:
	•	Kis type ke slices allowed hain
	•	Kaunse parameters change ho sakte hain
	•	Kaunse fixed rahenge
	•	Default values
	•	Constraints (limits)

📄 Technically:
	•	YAML file
	•	GitLab me stored

Example:

mojo-nsst-template-default.yml


⸻

3️⃣ Slice Template ka Creation Flow

STEP 1️⃣ User / Architect
	•	T-NAP Portal open karta hai
	•	Slice Template create karta hai

👉 Abhi:
	•	GUI partially available
	•	Mostly GitLab YAML hi source of truth hai

⸻

STEP 2️⃣ GitLab (SOURCE OF TRUTH)

Template yahan save hota hai:

ran-do-slice-templates/
 └── mojo-nsst-template-default.yml

Is YAML me hota hai:
	•	PLMN info
	•	SNSSAI
	•	Coverage
	•	Throughput
	•	UE limits
	•	input true/false

⸻

4️⃣ YAML ke andar kya hota hai? (Deep but simple)

🔹 PLMN Info

PLMN = Public Land Mobile Network

mcc: 262
mnc: 01

	•	MCC → Mobile Country Code
	•	MNC → Mobile Network Code
👉 Network kis operator ka hai

⸻

🔹 SNSSAI

Single Network Slice Selection Assistance Information

sst: integer
sd: string

	•	SST → Slice Service Type
	•	SD → Slice Differentiator

👉 Ye milke slice ko uniquely identify karte hain

⸻

🔹 Coverage Area

latitude
longitude
altitude
polygon

👉 Batata hai:
	•	Slice ka network kaunse area me active hoga

⚠️ Sirf wahi properties allowed:
	•	Jo actual network configure kar sakta hai

⸻

🔹 Performance Parameters

Download Throughput

dLThptPerSliceSubnet

Upload Throughput

uLThptPerSliceSubnet

Maximum UEs

maxNumberOfUEs


⸻

5️⃣ ⭐ MOST IMPORTANT: input: true / false

Ye sabse CRITICAL concept hai 🔥

✅ input: true

➡️ MDO value bhej sakta hai
➡️ Order payload se value aayegi

❌ input: false

➡️ MDO override nahi kar sakta
➡️ Template ka value final

🧠 Simple bolu:

input=true → order powerful
input=false → template powerful

⸻

6️⃣ Default Values & Constraints

Template me likh sakte ho:
	•	Default values
	•	Min / Max limit

Example:
	•	Max UE = 1000
	•	Guaranteed DL ≤ 5000 Mbps

👉 Agar MDO value nahi bheje:
➡️ Default use ho jayega

⸻

7️⃣ Template ID – Runtime Key 🔑

Jab template create hota hai:
	•	Ek unique ID generate hoti hai

Example:

uniqueId: 04564ae3-48cb-4de0-89d0-e7746c76dae8

👉 MDO isi ID ko use karke order place karega

⸻

8️⃣ Order Flow (Real Execution)

STEP 1️⃣ MDO → TMF 633
	•	Pehle check karta hai:
	•	Kaunse slice templates available hain

⸻

STEP 2️⃣ MDO → TMF 641 (Service Order)

POST /serviceOrder
{
  "serviceSpecification": {
    "id": "<slice-template-id>"
  },
  "serviceCharacteristic": [
    {
      "name": "sst",
      "value": 100
    }
  ]
}


⸻

STEP 3️⃣ RAN-DO Validation

RAN-DO kya karta hai:
	1.	Template ID valid hai?
	2.	Mandatory values present?
	3.	input=true values override allowed?
	4.	Constraints violated?
	5.	Default values apply karne hain?

❌ Agar kuch galat:
➡️ Order reject

⸻

STEP 4️⃣ Slice Lifecycle

Order states:
	•	reserved
	•	active
	•	terminated

👉 Network me slice provision ho jata hai

