🔁Reverse KT (Lead ke saamne bolne layak)

“RAN-DO me Slice Templates design-time YAML artifacts hote hain jo GitLab me store hote hain.
Ye templates define karte hain kaunse slice characteristics configurable hain, unke default values aur constraints.

MDO TMF 641 ke through slice order karta hai by referencing the template ID.
RAN-DO order ko validate karta hai, defaults apply karta hai, aur network me slice provision karta hai.”

